Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.13,0:00:02.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,光明与黑暗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.20,0:00:03.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在陷入一片混乱的战国时代
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.97,0:00:06.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了四魂之玉因缘际会聚在一起的伙伴们
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.33,0:00:07.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,穿越五百年的时光
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.90,0:00:12.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在最后仅存的四魂之玉碎片引导着各自的命运
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.21,0:00:13.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,战国时代的传奇故事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.51,0:00:14.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.48,0:00:18.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师与珊瑚之间 似有似无的微妙关系
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.15,0:00:20.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然珊瑚说他们两个人之间什么都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.88,0:00:24.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我却觉得他们之间感觉还不错
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.02,0:00:28.92,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You can now dream （勇敢的梦想） 挥起舞动{\fad(300,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.02,0:00:35.59,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I'm in a world （暧昧的世界） 奋力冲出吧{\fad(0,500)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.51,0:00:49.07,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,面对忧郁的现实生活{\fad(0,100)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.48,0:00:55.31,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不断在心中自我成长的勇者
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.45,0:01:01.45,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨夜的梦境及梦中残留的影像{\fad(0,50)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.49,0:01:06.43,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,断断续续提醒我「勇往直前」
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.63,0:01:14.33,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,破茧而出的我及含苞待放的未来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.44,0:01:19.00,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道你就将它禁锢起来吗{\fad(0,50)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.48,0:01:23.40,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You can now dream （勇敢的梦想） 挥起舞动
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.58,0:01:27.91,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Go and try （不顾一切的去尝试） 无尽的烦恼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.08,0:01:32.42,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,与你天长地久永不分离
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.59,0:01:35.36,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Do you need to cry （同样的哭泣） 和孤独相伴
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.46,0:01:39.95,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Show me a day fight （直接应战） 每当伤心流泪的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.13,0:01:46.73,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让它成为坚定不移的梦想吧{\fad(0,1000)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.88,0:02:33.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救…救命啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.45,0:02:44.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.83,0:02:49.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跑掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.53,0:02:59.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第131话 观音的挂轴 诅咒的陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.57,0:03:05.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是说都是鬼女的村子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.18,0:03:07.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没有骗你们 昨天晚上我亲眼看到的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.91,0:03:09.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在我去山中采药草
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.48,0:03:11.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不小心迷路的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.48,0:03:15.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我到处徘徊 不知不觉走到了沼泽地
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.49,0:03:17.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到一群女人搬了一个东西过来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.76,0:03:20.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后就把那个东西丢进沼泽里
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.99,0:03:22.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那会是什么东西呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.99,0:03:25.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,依我看那绝对是死尸没错
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.43,0:03:28.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且皮好像都已经被剥掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.27,0:03:31.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不是人类能做出来的事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.47,0:03:33.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是鬼 一定是鬼女做的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.97,0:03:37.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鬼女啊 听起来真恐怖
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.71,0:03:41.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是这附近感觉不到那么强烈的邪气
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.78,0:03:44.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 有没有四魂之玉碎片的气息
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.52,0:03:45.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完全没有
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.62,0:03:47.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是没有四魂之玉碎片的话
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.72,0:03:50.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还是不要去那么危险的地方吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.35,0:03:51.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那可不行
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.72,0:03:55.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们应该对每一个可疑的地方都要查清楚才对
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.06,0:03:57.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们想要在奈落之前
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.29,0:03:59.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到四魂之玉碎片的话
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.36,0:04:01.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就必须这么做
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.20,0:04:02.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.70,0:04:05.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落的目的…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.31,0:04:12.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝不能让他完成污秽的四魂之玉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.89,0:04:29.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这位姑娘 请问这附近有村庄吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.17,0:04:36.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,武士大人 您受伤了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.47,0:04:38.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.84,0:04:41.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚从战争之中逃出来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.27,0:04:42.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.61,0:04:43.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.84,0:04:47.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个村子还真是有点奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.78,0:04:49.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您觉得哪里奇怪了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.78,0:04:51.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从我刚才来到这里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.98,0:04:54.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到的就只有女人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.12,0:04:56.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,的确如此
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.55,0:04:58.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们这个村子里并没有男人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.92,0:05:00.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都死在战场上了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.13,0:05:03.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来如此 因为战争啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.63,0:05:06.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别说了 来吧 请武士大人先用个餐
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.43,0:05:12.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是 怎么会连个小孩跟老人都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.31,0:05:21.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,若菜
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.21,0:05:24.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把这个武士带到供奉观音菩萨的佛堂去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.38,0:05:28.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是…是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.53,0:05:43.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,若菜
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.84,0:05:47.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,若菜
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.91,0:05:55.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,若菜…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.12,0:06:08.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我睡着了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.36,0:06:12.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里是…佛堂里面吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.07,0:06:20.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是画吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.50,0:06:22.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是为什么这里面好像闪着光
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.86,0:06:45.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了 弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.40,0:06:47.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才我的确是感觉到了邪气
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.73,0:06:51.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说是邪气吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.54,0:06:54.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然只有一瞬间 但是我确实感觉到了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.92,0:07:09.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里好像就是刚才那位老伯说的鬼女沼泽
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.49,0:07:11.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很可能就是这里
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.69,0:07:16.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像有什么奇怪的东西漂过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.06,0:07:21.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难…难道是…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.01,0:07:28.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死掉了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.94,0:07:30.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有 还没死
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.51,0:07:32.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就不能别那么粗鲁吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.85,0:07:36.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的名字叫筱助
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.71,0:07:38.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来 请用
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.58,0:07:40.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.29,0:07:46.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛 一脸苦闷的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.79,0:07:48.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要这样说人家啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.09,0:07:50.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.23,0:07:54.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说你在寻找下落不明 遍寻不着的未婚妻是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.87,0:07:55.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.17,0:07:58.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大概是在距离婚礼三天之前的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.97,0:08:00.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我被迫上了战场
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.60,0:08:02.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后来受到很重的伤
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.24,0:08:04.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,整整两年时间没办法回来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.11,0:08:06.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,前几天
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.24,0:08:09.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我好不容易回到了生长的故乡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.25,0:08:11.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没想到村子已经被烧毁
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.95,0:08:15.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的未婚妻若菜也不知去向
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.12,0:08:18.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然她生死不明 我还是到处找她
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.99,0:08:20.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在快要绝望的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.69,0:08:23.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我听说这附近有一个只有女人的村落
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.49,0:08:25.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有女人的村落
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.00,0:08:27.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还听说那个村子里
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.83,0:08:31.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全都是在战争中失去了孩子丈夫的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.90,0:08:34.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家相依为命在那里生活着
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.34,0:08:39.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以 我在想说不定若菜
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.44,0:08:42.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她现在也在那个村落里生活着
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.98,0:08:43.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.75,0:08:47.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听起来好像跟鬼女村落有什么关系耶
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.45,0:08:50.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为村子都是只有女人嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.62,0:08:52.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.49,0:08:54.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就让我们跟你同行吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.63,0:08:57.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是 我根本不知道在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.19,0:08:58.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.50,0:09:02.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,依我看 对方好像已经主动找过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.60,0:09:08.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错 这里的确就是在战争中
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.61,0:09:11.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,失去孩子跟丈夫的女人的村落
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.84,0:09:14.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在这里互相扶持勉强度日
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.75,0:09:19.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是 这里没有你要找的那位叫若菜的女孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.89,0:09:24.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.29,0:09:25.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有在这里耶
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.86,0:09:27.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是遗憾
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.13,0:09:29.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你打算怎么办呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.43,0:09:32.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会继续找找看
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.80,0:09:34.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我绝对不能放弃的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.00,0:09:36.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能够跟我共度一生的伴侣
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.90,0:09:38.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有若菜一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.90,0:09:40.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是专情
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.54,0:09:42.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真叫人羡慕
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.11,0:09:46.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没有别的意思
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.55,0:09:55.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样 弥勒
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.29,0:09:59.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有没有感觉到妖气还是邪气
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.29,0:10:03.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的鼻子只有闻到水的气味
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.06,0:10:06.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闻不到其他什么可疑的气味…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.56,0:10:09.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有女人的生活 一定很没有安全感吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.17,0:10:10.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有没有在听啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.80,0:10:12.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 法师大人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.07,0:10:17.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看他这样子应该没有发现邪气
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.91,0:10:19.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过有杀气
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.91,0:10:22.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师 我们是不是差不多该走了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.95,0:10:27.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想这个地方应该不是我们要找的鬼女村吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.18,0:10:28.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.22,0:10:30.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请等一下 旅行的朋友们
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.59,0:10:32.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走夜路是很危险的事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.42,0:10:34.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然我们没什么东西可以招待你们
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.69,0:10:36.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请你们今天晚上就住在这里吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.69,0:10:39.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 那我们恭敬不如从命了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.23,0:10:40.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.43,0:10:43.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么 姑娘们请跟我们一起走
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.30,0:10:44.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,男士们请走这边
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.70,0:10:46.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要分开睡吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.61,0:10:49.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.07,0:10:52.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看我们还是继续上路吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.21,0:10:53.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.48,0:10:56.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明是你一口答应人家要住下来的不是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.25,0:10:57.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.71,0:11:00.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟我们一起住你不满意吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.19,0:11:10.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这个荒凉的村落就只有女人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.13,0:11:13.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以偶尔有客人来 我们也会很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.53,0:11:15.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么 请好好休息
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.64,0:11:21.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了 今天不用餐风露宿了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.24,0:11:23.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,话是这么说没错
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.14,0:11:26.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们本来应该尽快去找鬼女村才对的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.21,0:11:29.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师真是的 又露出好色的本性
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.75,0:11:35.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底在哪里 若菜
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.66,0:11:45.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,筱助 你还活着呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.90,0:11:48.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.67,0:11:51.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直以为你已经战死了 所以才会…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.54,0:11:55.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想回到心爱的男人身边吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.91,0:11:57.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,若菜
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.67,0:11:59.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我马上就让你跟他见面
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.54,0:12:01.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是 必须在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.78,0:12:05.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了我去把男人带来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.95,0:12:08.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.79,0:12:09.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.92,0:12:12.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底对珊瑚是怎么想的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.43,0:12:16.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之前去白灵山的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.06,0:12:19.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是只有你跟珊瑚两个人独处吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.66,0:12:20.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说那个时候的事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.96,0:12:23.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个时候什么事都没有发生吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.20,0:12:24.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞来骨
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.30,0:12:27.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可是风之使者呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.58,0:12:34.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.78,0:12:39.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚 珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.92,0:12:42.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一定要撑下去 珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.32,0:12:48.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是让人感动呀 法师
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.79,0:12:50.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是一个人先走的话
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.59,0:12:53.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你才能多活一会儿呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.64,0:13:02.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没办法发动风穴了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.64,0:13:05.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为在怕那些毒虫吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.24,0:13:07.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也未免太小看我弥勒了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.88,0:13:09.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了自己心爱的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.11,0:13:12.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算要我赴汤蹈火
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.62,0:13:14.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拼了这条命不要也没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.85,0:13:18.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风穴
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.90,0:13:29.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虫毒…开始扩散了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.54,0:13:34.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样 什么事都没发生吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.91,0:13:36.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有没有 都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.24,0:13:38.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么事都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.54,0:13:39.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.89,0:13:52.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚 你跟弥勒法师真的没什么吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.66,0:13:56.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是指没有什么东西啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.63,0:13:58.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为上次在白灵山的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.13,0:14:01.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们两个人不是一直独处吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.27,0:14:04.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在那段时间 没有留下什么美好的回忆吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.68,0:14:14.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚 你还是先走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.28,0:14:15.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算只有你…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.55,0:14:17.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不走 要走也要一起走
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.72,0:14:23.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来这一次 我有点勉强过度了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.19,0:14:26.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以 至少也要让你活下去
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.92,0:14:28.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不要
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.09,0:14:31.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,与其把你留在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.30,0:14:34.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我宁愿陪你一起死
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.03,0:14:36.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.67,0:14:42.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在情不自禁的情况下说了那些话
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.21,0:14:42.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过在那之后
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.04,0:14:45.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师的态度好像一点都没有改变啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.71,0:14:49.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们真的什么事都没有吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.68,0:14:52.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的没有啦 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.22,0:14:55.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟弥勒法师之间不是你想的那种关系啦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.62,0:14:59.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是珊瑚 你应该是喜欢弥勒法师吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.76,0:15:02.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这…这怎么可能嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.63,0:15:04.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁会喜欢那种到处勾搭女生的色狼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.36,0:15:05.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.00,0:15:07.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是心事都很清楚地写在脸上了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.83,0:15:11.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做事毫无分寸、又轻佻、还面不改色的说谎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.27,0:15:15.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.01,0:15:20.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是我觉得弥勒法师其实他是很喜欢你的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.58,0:15:22.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为…为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.98,0:15:24.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该怎么说呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.88,0:15:27.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得你对他来说很特别
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.15,0:15:28.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以他很重视你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.09,0:15:30.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.89,0:15:33.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对吧 云母也这么觉得对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.40,0:15:39.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了 云母
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.66,0:15:42.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来是这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.40,0:15:43.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的丈夫因为战争去世了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.13,0:15:44.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.80,0:15:48.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我能成为你心灵的上慰借
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.74,0:15:49.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随时都可以奉陪
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.81,0:15:52.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真的很高兴 法师大人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.55,0:15:59.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.28,0:16:01.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要睡了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.12,0:16:03.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 这样好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.62,0:16:05.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就这样让弥勒走了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.16,0:16:06.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别管他了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.52,0:16:09.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总比听他整个晚上在这边唉声叹气来的好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.63,0:16:12.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚一定会生气的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.50,0:16:13.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.00,0:16:16.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说你…真的是个大傻瓜吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.20,0:16:19.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个 不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.00,0:16:23.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想要先休息了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.94,0:16:25.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我打算明天一大早就离开这里
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.04,0:16:29.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再去其他地方找我的未婚妻若菜
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.85,0:16:31.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你自便吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.95,0:16:38.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚好可怜
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.36,0:16:40.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过其实她不用硬撑
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.96,0:16:43.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直接阻止弥勒法师就好了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.69,0:16:45.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过不可能吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.56,0:16:48.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了 云母
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.97,0:16:50.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.34,0:16:58.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.68,0:17:00.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟过去看看
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.81,0:17:04.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等 我去叫犬夜叉跟弥勒法师过来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.02,0:17:07.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想他们一定就在附近
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.15,0:17:10.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用了 现在没有时间去找他们了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.42,0:17:13.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.94,0:17:30.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这股气味是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.65,0:17:35.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,水吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.98,0:17:37.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 应该不是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.15,0:17:41.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是水中生物的味道 而且数量还不少
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.66,0:17:44.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么事啊 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.42,0:17:45.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.06,0:17:47.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,睡你们的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.73,0:17:51.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 珊瑚一个人追过去了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.20,0:17:52.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.47,0:17:56.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,水中生物的气味
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.14,0:17:58.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然还不知道是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.74,0:18:00.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是这个气味突然扑鼻而来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.74,0:18:03.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恐怕就在那些女人开始行动的同一时间
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.75,0:18:15.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,筱助
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.99,0:18:20.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,若菜
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.29,0:18:21.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,若菜
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.76,0:18:24.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我找你找得有多辛苦吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.17,0:18:28.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,法师大人 请往这边走
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.47,0:18:29.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.51,0:18:37.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在佛堂里面的话
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.94,0:18:40.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是会遭到观音菩萨惩罚的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.97,0:19:05.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.81,0:19:08.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么多人一下子跑到哪去了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.06,0:19:26.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母 云母
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.34,0:19:36.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.84,0:19:41.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.44,0:19:46.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚会在哪里呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.18,0:19:49.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚的气味突然消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.35,0:19:51.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说不定是遁入水里去了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.09,0:19:53.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什…什么
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.02,0:19:55.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 往后退
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.86,0:20:04.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是村里的人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.60,0:20:06.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我问你们 你们把珊瑚怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.17,0:20:08.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是你们敢把她藏起来的话
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.90,0:20:10.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.90,0:20:13.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她们的嘴里好像吐出了一股邪气
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.84,0:20:19.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定是有什么人在背后控制她们
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.41,0:20:21.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你千万不能伤害她们
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.55,0:20:27.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞了半天 我们还是不知不觉中
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.89,0:20:29.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到了什么鬼女村了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.89,0:20:35.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,法师大人 请你好好安慰我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.40,0:20:40.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然有邪气
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.97,0:20:43.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她的肚子里有什么东西吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.20,0:20:46.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 为什么每次都这样
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.64,0:20:47.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.14,0:20:50.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想你只是被人控制住了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.65,0:20:53.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那才是幕后主使者
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.72,0:20:58.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 你是什么妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.85,0:21:02.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把你的人皮交出来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.19,0:21:04.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说人皮？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.60,0:21:11.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,醒过来了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.54,0:21:18.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里是…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.71,0:21:21.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我马上就可以让你也加入我们的行列
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.22,0:21:33.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.02,0:21:35.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像是什么动物的蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.52,0:21:37.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧 把它吞下去
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.70,0:21:45.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要咬 直接吞下去就对了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.93,0:21:49.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过不了多久 蛋就会在你的肚子里孵化出来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.24,0:21:52.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到时候你就能够成为我们的伙伴了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.37,0:21:56.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可…可恶 谁要吃这种东西
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.99,0:22:24.17,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如今内心充满着悲伤的话{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.01,0:22:40.41,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}尽管靠着我哭吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.47,0:22:46.60,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}I get   I get   I get   get the feeling
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.61,0:22:50.13,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}I get   I get   I get   get the dreaming
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.13,0:22:56.00,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就像现在这样{\fad(0,400)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.51,0:23:06.31,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}Come my way  这点黑暗之尘
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.48,0:23:14.41,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}Come close to me  现在灯已照亮了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.59,0:23:17.67,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}I'll be with you  I'll be with you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.99,0:23:22.26,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只是简简单单的陪在你身边
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.36,0:23:28.81,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}So Come my way{\fad(0,600)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.09,0:23:52.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚被妖怪控制住 竟然开始攻击弥勒
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.09,0:23:54.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们两个怎么能够反目成仇呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.03,0:23:56.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你吞了那个奇怪的东西吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.60,0:23:58.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我马上救你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.36,0:24:01.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比起鬼女村的女人 你果然没那么容易对付
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.77,0:24:02.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.80,0:24:05.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,与你为敌 真的是一件很可怕的事
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.61,0:24:08.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是我也不能束手就擒
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.51,0:24:10.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.01,0:24:13.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师最危险的告白
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.65,0:24:16.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对我来说 你是最特别的女人
